# `test/r7rs-suite-tests.sh --discover` writes a DRAFT exclusion manifest beside the real
# one. It is generated scratch: it duplicates exclusions.tsv's keys but carries the raw
# untagged errors instead of the curated reasons, so the two disagree by design, and every
# discovery run rewrites it.
test/r7rs/exclusions.tsv.draft
